Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已在路上漂泊了几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been on the road for a couple of months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前你住在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you live before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一座小镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有这些怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were the monsters there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:02:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full of good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.45,0:03:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌管大权的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点死在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely got out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:05:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去就像差点死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you barely got out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔拉 - 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tara. - I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有点精神紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a little on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直躲在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been holed up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着国民警卫队 自从…\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for the National Guard since…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他妈的一切大乱开始 - 注意用词\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The shit hit the fan. - Language.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.81,0:06:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从一切大乱开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the crap hit the fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就蔓延到了整个区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}right before it got flung all over the damn place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算待在大楼里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you planning on staying in the building?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底打不打算留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you planning on staying or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 这是个哑巴 - 塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy shit, with the no talking. - Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹问了你一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.19,0:06:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只过一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一把装满子弹的标配史密斯威森手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here is a fully loaded, standard issue Smith & Wesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.99,0:06:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是亚特兰大警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Atlanta City Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有足够的枪支弹药 可以在接下来十年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have enough artillery in here to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天杀死你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}every day for the next 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是敢耍我或者我家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mess with me or my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向耶稣发誓 我会干掉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I swear to Christ, I will put you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,来击拳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pound it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.03,0:07:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你走之前 这个我们得留着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hold onto this until you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·赫里奥特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian Heriot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面没什么更好的东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna find anything better in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从威尔海姆小姐去了佛罗里达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara ransacked the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉就将那里洗劫一空\N{\fnArial\fs30}after Miss Wilhelm took off for Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔海姆小姐最爱吃棉豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big fan of butter beans, Miss Wilhelm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…四 五\N{\fnArial\fs30}…four, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 孩子 看看你的牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kiddo. Show me what you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又开始不吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't eat again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爱吃腌牛肉 试试那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}She likes the corned beef. Try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后两罐我是留给老爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saving the last two cans for Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是挑食 只是害怕而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not picky, she's terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 您悠着点可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you slow down, buddy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里又不是假日酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't the Holiday Inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,左侧的木桶是洗涤用水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bucket on the left is for washing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,右侧是清水\N{\fnArial\fs30}right is for rinsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你够吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get enough to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你倒点咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那儿坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再掷一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, roll again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 过来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有香烟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 你的氧气筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, your oxygen tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看见警告标志吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not see that red sticker?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们千辛万苦才活到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned if a Merit Ultra Menthol is gonna blow this place up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不能因为你抽烟而把这地方炸掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all the work we've done to stay alive up here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 莉莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all the same, Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能别这样说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stop that talk right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就是讨根烟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,请自便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的肉干够吃好几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got roni sticks for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定能撑几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见外面停的大货车了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that big truck parked outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.61,0:11:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那辆戈贝利食品货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dude, the Gorbelli food truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷·查尔斯都可以看见（盲人歌手）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray Charles could have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸给他们开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad drove for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是还背着氧气瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当时关闭了75号公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day they closed down the 75…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,从「他-妈-的」天下大乱开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the S-H-I-T hit the fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从学校接了梅根 到医院接了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He grabbed Megan from school, picked me up at the hospital…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还从医院里偷了几个氧气瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stole a bunch of oxygen tanks from that dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着我们仨一起去接塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the three of us rushed over to get Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时在警局上班 登记犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was at the station working, booking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}With everything going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸袭来 军队进驻亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}the attacks, the Army going into Atlanta,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直让我们和他寸步不离\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wasn't about to let us out of his sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.70,0:12:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好我们走运 老爸的货车里囤满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky for us, the old man's truck was pretty much stocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,堆到天花板的意面圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}floor to ceiling with sketti rings,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,火鸡辣酱汤 还有这些零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}turkey chili, and these little suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,小梅 爷爷得休息一下了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meggie, Granddad needs a break, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉莉 - 来了 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lily. - Sure, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大个子 过来搭把手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little help here, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.99,0:12:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 叫的不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. No, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是屋里的另外一个大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other big guy in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, one, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到那些东西了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,能抬一下我的腿吗 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my legs, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉上去了好几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara's been up there a bunch of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些混球轰成碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}blasting them bastards to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说那些东西怎么也打不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says they just keep getting back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她别再上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让她继续浪费子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't afford to waste her bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有小孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿们出生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my girls were born,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.00,0:13:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于明白了成为一个男人意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's when I finally figured out what it was to be a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 一个真男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.33,0:13:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保护她们 保证她们安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You protect them, you keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.87,0:13:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你花尽心思让她们变得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just try to make them stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到她们能照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}until they can look out for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… this here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未想过她们会遇上这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I never counted on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got a buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔·詹金斯 他住在303\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill Jenkins, he lives up in 303.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他那儿有套很棒的双陆棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a real nice backgammon set up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会介意的 他把棋放在床底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't mind and he keeps it under his bed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面生活过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been out there in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在那些东西周围如何自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know how to handle yourself around those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你也许不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you might not understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你没有女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you don't got a baby girl of your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西也许能让我的梅根重新开始说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might be something that might make my Megan talk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.71,0:14:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:22.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一切都会过去）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你上路带的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple things for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.17,0:18:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You helped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的谢意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己看着办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计你需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you'll be needing this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那玩意儿扔我\N{\fnArial\fs30}throw that at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.05,0:18:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以拿回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也需要一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该搜你的身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have frisked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在楼上发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留着那把吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要命中脑袋才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to kill the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姐姐冲着它们的身体射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister, she shot 'em in the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们得射这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have to hit 'em here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才能杀死它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what kills them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有些事情得求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸的肺癌已经到晚期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's got stage four lung cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.53,0:19:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多年照顾肿瘤病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked oncology for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看出他快不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's nearing the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的氧气还剩两天的量\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got about two days of oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许更少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe less.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从没想过他能挺这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never thought he'd make it this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.14,0:20:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经为我们做了很多 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already done so much for us, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个街区之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's an old folks home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一家老人院\N{\fnArial\fs30}a couple of blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.97,0:20:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只有一罐也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even one tank would mean everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是唯一能让梅根微笑的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only one who can put a smile on Megan's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只有一秒也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.71,0:23:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个都是满的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're both full.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.81,0:23:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.05,0:23:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.09,0:24:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没让我说谢谢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't let me say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.33,0:24:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.44,0:24:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我重操旧业护理你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me be a nurse again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.83,0:24:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是你不需要缝针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news is it doesn't look like you need any stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.69,0:24:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会像狂蜂蜇了一样疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is gonna sting like a couple of angry bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.72,0:24:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事做的感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels good to have something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.13,0:24:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没人说起过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody ever mentioned just.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日竟然会这么无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}how boring the end of the world was gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为你是她爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thought you were her dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.57,0:25:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.67,0:25:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她看见你在街上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she saw you out there on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.33,0:25:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年半前的一个晚上 他出了门\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went out one night about three and a half years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.62,0:25:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去买几瓶啤酒和强力球彩票\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get a couple beers and a Powerball ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.92,0:25:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he'd be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.62,0:25:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根把你认成了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan thought you were him,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.57,0:25:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为你终于回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}finally coming right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.33,0:25:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 在这里 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mama. - In here, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.24,0:26:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很好 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's okay, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.41,0:26:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩受了点小伤 需要清理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian just got a boo-boo that needs a little cleaning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.22,0:26:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟你被割伤时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as when you get a cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.71,0:26:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没拿药膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the ointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿药 你帮我看护一下病人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you watch my patient until I get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.05,0:26:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.86,0:26:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼睛怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.78,0:26:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.27,0:26:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你一生下来就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}or were you just born like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.68,0:26:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.43,0:26:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是不该问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that bad to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.60,0:27:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.60,0:27:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你我的眼睛怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what happened to my eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.03,0:27:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得发誓保守秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have to promise to keep it secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.49,0:27:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.84,0:27:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.47,0:27:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉钩上吊不许变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinkie swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.24,0:27:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,发誓保密 否则不得好死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus cross my heart and hope to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.09,0:27:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.50,0:27:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.51,0:27:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.07,0:27:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你识破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you caught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是我救人的时候出了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What really happened was I was trying to help someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.11,0:28:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救我深爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone I loved very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.34,0:28:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么帮助他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How were you trying to help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.16,0:28:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想尽力保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to protect them, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.49,0:28:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让他们受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop them getting hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.14,0:28:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你自己却受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got hurt instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.13,0:28:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.61,0:28:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they get hurt, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.77,0:28:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 也受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.19,0:28:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.99,0:28:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.15,0:28:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.89,0:28:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际象棋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.47,0:28:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来好难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.83,0:28:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对有些人来说可能会难 但你很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe for some folks, but you're smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.49,0:28:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就能学会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll catch on quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.06,0:28:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个棋子叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this one called?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.04,0:28:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是卒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.44,0:29:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是你的士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're your soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.37,0:29:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.44,0:29:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.21,0:29:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们都死了 你就输了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you lose if they die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.07,0:29:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.85,0:29:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你折损了很多小卒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can lose a lot of soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是可以翻盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}but still win the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.19,0:29:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.33,0:29:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要想办法俘获他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy you want to capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.53,0:29:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.68,0:29:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.30,0:29:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.72,0:29:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.43,0:30:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来下棋吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.52,0:30:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是卒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So these ones are pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.39,0:31:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.18,0:31:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他去世有一会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's been gone a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.48,0:31:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.17,0:31:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.58,0:31:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.85,0:31:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手 你在干什么 - 那不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! What are you doing? - It's not Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.96,0:31:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快住手 - 它不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - It's not Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.47,0:32:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.52,0:33:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事迟早会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens no matter what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.80,0:33:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.16,0:33:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.32,0:33:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许会咬到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.66,0:33:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点就咬到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He almost got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.69,0:33:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.97,0:33:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他还在 一定会很感激你\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would have been grateful or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.82,0:33:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,及时制止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you stopped him, from him…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.31,0:33:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.70,0:33:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们没闹翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, we're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.40,0:35:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.56,0:35:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.78,0:35:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要跟你一起去 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're coming with you. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.49,0:35:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有更安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be someplace better,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.87,0:35:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要帮我们找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna help us find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.21,0:35:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莉莉 - 我看到照片了 布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lily. - I saw the picture, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.14,0:35:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾有家人 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a family, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.17,0:35:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道我们不是她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know we're not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.88,0:35:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就现在来说 你必须跟我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for now, you're stuck with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.64,0:35:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只有这一个办法 - 我不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that's just the way it's gonna be. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.28,0:35:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.12,0:35:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.29,0:35:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划赶不上变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}No use making a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能看着它们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go where they let us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.83,0:35:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's they?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.60,0:35:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.07,0:36:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.03,0:36:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实不算是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.85,0:36:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也不全是谎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not a total lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.55,0:36:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警校学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.70,0:36:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉对你说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.98,0:36:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必感到抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.23,0:36:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.36,0:36:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们能活下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we can make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.26,0:36:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.58,0:36:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在骗我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you lying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.49,0:36:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.93,0:37:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以过来 梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come join us, Megan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.67,0:37:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,过段时间就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just gonna take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.51,0:37:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.03,0:38:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就能找到车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another car soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.95,0:38:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.25,0:39:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这乡村景色总是让我想起萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole country backdrop is reminding me of Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.80,0:39:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又来了 - 我以为她是我的真命天女\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we go. - I thought she was the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.16,0:39:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们去野营 吃了致幻蘑菇 全完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you went camping, ate mushrooms, game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.86,0:39:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're forgetting the part where.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.94,0:39:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆崩溃了 然后告诉我她有男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam broke down and told me she had a boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.95,0:39:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她其实不喜欢妹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that she wasn't really into chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.02,0:39:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我一生中最糟糕的周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, worst weekend of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.21,0:39:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.12,0:39:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.80,0:39:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.17,0:39:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔拉 停下 让我看看 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tara, stop. Let me look at it. - I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.10,0:39:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把背包给我 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hand me my backpack. I'm fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.82,0:39:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能走路吗 - 可以 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you walk? - Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.33,0:39:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.27,0:39:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下包 我们走 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your bags. Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.10,0:39:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅根 - 梅根 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Megan. - Megan, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.32,0:39:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根 现在快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan, right now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.40,0:39:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅根 - 快啊 梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Megan! - Come on, Megan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.76,0:40:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.80,0:40:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根 快点走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan, right now. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 梅根 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Megan. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.83,0:40:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.33,0:40:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.95,0:40:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.21,0:40:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.10,0:40:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.69,0:41:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布莱恩 - 我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Brian! - I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.67,0:41:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.81,0:41:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.90,0:41:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让任何事伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never gonna let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.22,0:41:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.11,0:42:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你发誓 - 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Promise? - Cross my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.54,0:42:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,活见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.17,0:42:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cross my heart.
